  "reason": "The current best is config_032 (scvi_n200, vit_l, transformer, weighted) at 0.725 acc / 0.685 F1. All top performers share scvi_n200 + transformer aggregation, confirming these as the key design choices. The remaining uncertainty is whether the resnet50 + transformer + concat combination (config_043) with scvi_n200 can approach or exceed config_032, given that config_014 (resnet50, transformer, weighted) achieved the highest F1 (0.6945) of any experiment, suggesting resnet50 may capture complementary features. Config_043 is the closest untested variant to the best configuration, using the best RNA encoder and aggregation while testing the concat fusion alternative with resnet50. As the final experiment, it provides the most informative confirmation of the design space without introducing a clearly inferior encoder (scgpt/pca) or singleprofile setting. Expected cost: ~5.5–6.2 GPU hours (comparable to config_014 at 6.22 hrs, possibly slightly lower with concat fusion), keeping total budget around 43–44 GPU hours."
